# SafeCheck AI settings
# ---------------------
# 1. Copy this file and name the copy ".env" (in this same server folder).
# 2. Paste your own API key below. The .env file is git-ignored and is only
#    ever read by the server, so your key is never sent to the browser.
# 3. Restart `npm run dev`.
#
# If AI_API_KEY is empty, SafeCheck runs in demo mode: the example messages
# show pre-written results and live checking is turned off.

# ---- Option A: Groq (free key) -------------------------------------------
# Get a free key: https://console.groq.com/keys  (sign in, then "Create API Key")
# Current model names: https://console.groq.com/docs/models
# Models that can read screenshots: https://console.groq.com/docs/vision
AI_API_KEY=
AI_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
AI_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
AI_VISION_MODEL=qwen/qwen3.8-27b

# ---- Option B: xAI Grok ----------------------------------------------------
# Get a key: https://console.x.ai  (API Keys)
# Current model names: https://docs.x.ai/docs/models
# Pick a model that supports image input for AI_VISION_MODEL.
# AI_API_KEY=
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.x.ai/v1
# AI_MODEL=grok-4.7
# AI_VISION_MODEL=grok-4.7

# Optional: the port the API server listens on (Vite forwards /api to it).
# API_PORT=3001
